{"id":"C96966d8ddcbd21ca115f","zh":"时变接触刚度","en":"time-varying contact stiffness","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","definition_zh":"随时间或接触状态改变的轮轨接触刚度。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":"用于轮轨接触的数值建模，在所述车辆—轨道垂向振动模型中，根据轮轨压缩状态随积分步更新接触弹簧刚度，以反映接触状态的变化。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C96966d8ddcbd21ca115f","zh":"时变接触刚度","en":"time-varying contact stiffness","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","group_id":"H045607dc6e16225b2f92","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道不平顺与信号处理 · 贺天龙等（2017）"}],"designations":[{"id":"D7a8e2f7b7f2d15b97f09","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"时变接触刚度"},{"id":"D2a0eab60135200212d71","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"time-varying contact stiffness"}],"sources":{"P108":{"id":"P108","title":"基于轮轨时变接触刚度的车辆−轨道系统垂向振动分析","authors":"贺天龙,陈宪麦,徐磊","year":"2017","doi":"10.11817/j.issn.1672−7207.2017.08.023","journal_citation":"中南大学学报(自然科学版)","label":"贺天龙等（2017）","overview_slug":"2017-vehicle-track-system-vertical-vibration-analysis-based-on-wheel-rail-time-varying-contact-stiffness"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S55e08fd5ded2bf639674","source_id":"P108","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"en","text":"A vertical and unified equation of the vehicle-track system was established with finite element theory and energy variation method, and wheel-rail time-varying contact stiffness replaced wheel-track nonlinear contact force on dynamic effects to simulate the natural contact between wheel and rail.","citations":[{"source_id":"P108","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Sc754166e49c297480888","source_id":"P108","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"采用轮轨时变接触刚度代替轮轨非线性接触力的动力效应,模拟轮轨之间的自然接触状态,将有限元理论和能量变分法用于建立车辆−轨道系统垂向统一方程。","citations":[{"source_id":"P108","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S1cca4e1047b31fb18a87","source_id":"P108","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"本文作者采用轮/轨时变接触刚度的方法模拟轮轨之间的自然接触状态,通过能量变分和有限元建立车辆−轨道系统的统一方程,验证模型的正确性。","citations":[{"source_id":"P108","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C